  "GET /game/holdings": {"key": "GET /game/holdings", "method": "GET", "path": "/game/holdings", "tag": "game", "summary": "What the caller has acquired in one game", "params": [{"name": "game_id", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "slug", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "kind", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "page", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "page_size", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}], "description": "Each row is joined to its artifact, because a holdings list renders as a list of THINGS and an id alone renders nothing. A holding whose artifact has been withdrawn is omitted rather than cascaded away, so it returns if the artifact is restored.", "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "A page of the caller’s holdings, most recently acquired first", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"type": "object", "required": ["items", "total", "page", "pageSize"], "properties": {"items": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameHoldingWithArtifact"}}, "total": {"type": "integer"}, "page": {"type": "integer"}, "pageSize": {"type": "integer"}}}}, {"status": "400", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "401", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "404", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "409", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}], "security": ["bearerAuth"], "family": ["DELETE /game/holdings", "GET /game/holdings", "PUT /game/holdings"]},
  "GET /game/instances": {"key": "GET /game/instances", "method": "GET", "path": "/game/instances", "tag": "game", "summary": "The caller’s own instances, including what is inside what they hold", "params": [{"name": "game_id", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "slug", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}, {"name": "depth", "in": "query", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}}], "description": "A recursive containment walk: everything located on the player, plus everything located inside those, and so on — the chest in the inventory and the key in the chest. Two INDEPENDENT bounds, and neither substitutes for the other: a depth cap (default and maximum 32) cuts a containment cycle, and a hard row limit (2000) cuts breadth, because a cycle at depth 2 fanning out ten ways per level is still 10^32 rows inside the depth cap. The row limit is applied BEFORE the sort, so a truncated walk returns the rows the walk reached first (shallowest first) rather than the smallest 2000 by sort key; on a well-formed world nothing is truncated and the two are the same. `location_id` carries no FK, so nothing is read from the request: the player id comes from the caller’s own resolved profile. A caller who has never played gets an empty list, not a 404.", "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "The caller’s instances, shallowest first", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"type": "object", "required": ["items", "total"], "properties": {"items": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameInstance"}}, "total": {"type": "integer"}}}}, {"status": "400", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "401", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "404", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}, {"status": "409", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}], "security": ["bearerAuth"], "family": ["GET /game/instances"]},
  "GET /game/mappings": {"key": "GET /game/mappings", "method": "GET", "path": "/game/mappings", "tag": "game", "summary": "List mappings", "params": [], "description": "List mappings.", "responses": [{"status": "200", "description": "List", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"type": "array", "items": {"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema", "type": "object", "properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 36}, "ecosystemId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 36}, "gameId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 36}, "fromId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 36}, "kind": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 32}, "toId": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 36}, "amount": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -2147483648, "maximum": 2147483647}, "sortOrder": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -2147483648, "maximum": 2147483647}, "createdAt": {"type": "string"}, "updatedAt": {"type": "string"}, "deletedAt": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "syncVersion": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -9007199254740991, "maximum": 9007199254740991}, "syncStampedAt": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "syncTxid": {"type": "integer", "minimum": -9007199254740991, "maximum": 9007199254740991}}, "required": ["id", "ecosystemId", "gameId", "fromId", "kind", "toId", "amount", "sortOrder", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "deletedAt", "syncVersion", "syncStampedAt", "syncTxid"], "additionalProperties": false}}}, {"status": "401", "description": "Error", "contentType": "application/json", "schema": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"}}], "security": ["bearerAuth"], "family": ["DELETE /game/mappings/{id}", "GET /game/mappings", "GET /game/mappings/{id}", "POST /game/mappings", "PUT /game/mappings/{id}"]},
